rection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>② 作业</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>传统方式：以课时统一布置，订正后继续课程。完整模式：共同目标下安排个人适配任务，含本课巩固与旧知识复习，批改后继续安排验证，并控制总负担。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>③ 刷题</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>传统方式：按章节、教辅或个人经验选题。完整模式：按套路顺序与知识准备推荐，利用六步循环、步骤补练和新变式检查迁移，而不是机械堆量。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>④ 反思</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>传统方式：看分数、抄订正或自行总结。完整模式：对照步骤与可用时间线回看错误，确认原因、记录待验证事项，转成下一项可执行的训练。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340',